Cell["\<\
Below the threshold the most visited extension is far from a segment; at the \
threshold the excess drops to zero in one step and stays there. The most \
visited member jumps from a walk near the germ to a segment.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"660512c4-e634-4fd9-9a48-f0d81e37408a"],

Cell["\<\
The triangular and the hexagonal tilings share the threshold; the square \
tiling reaches it one scale later.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"304c6312-749f-4ccc-9077-5cfe6b3e925a"],

Cell["The chord deviation against the scale.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"530f54fa-39a5-434a-986d-b38c025fb391"],

